 *     MCPVersion:
 *       .pom - Pom meta linking against net.minecraft:client:extra and net.minecraft:client:data
 *       '' - Notch named merged jar file
 *       srg - Srg named jar file.
 *       srg-sources - Srg named decompiled/patched code.
 *   mappings_{channel}:
 *     MCPVersion|MCVersion:
